normalized_output:
NUMBER n.
INPUT(n).
NUMBER left=1.
NUMBER right=n.
LOOP (left<=right) {
    NUMBER middle=(left+right)/2.
    NUMBER times=middle*n.
    IF (times>=0) { left=middle+1. }
    ELSE { right=middle-1. }
}
